WEBVTT

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.640
It's Crash and Coco! Get them!

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.500
She's annoying!

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:19.760
Okay, okay, okay. Now, let's battle!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.320
Call and Makuta!

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.600
Hiya!

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.110
Super Kick!

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:31.550
Hey, we use Super Kick a lot. Let's use...

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:37.010
Ah! Hey! Bazooka!

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:42.100
You're Annoying!

00:00:50.060 --> 00:01:39.080
Bazooka! Use the Howitzer!

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.120
Howitzer?

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:41.380
Howitzer!

00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:53.430
Use your Bazooka!

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:53.630
Hiya!

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.570
Use your Bazooka!

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:06.140
Let me use that.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:09.980
Bazooka!

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.700
I found the Catawg Claw!

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:16.120
Whatever.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.630
Laser eyes!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:40.700
Okay.

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.940
Bazooka time!

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:48.800
I can't squeeze my hand in it.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.700
Look, and I can even...

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.300
I think...

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.580
Bazooka!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:01.780
I guess so.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:17.960
Last for a minute.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.270
Nice trick!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:04:16.390
Watch for Snakey.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:18.990
Snakey? Is that what you named it?

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:21.590
You actually named a monster Snakey?

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.150
Yes, I did!

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:24.850
I think it's a worm.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.350
A worm. He named a...

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:30.390
He named a 30-foot worm Snakey?

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:33.130
I mean, a 60-foot worm Snakey?

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.270
I'd put it in a museum.

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:38.610
I'd use a...

00:04:38.610 --> 00:05:18.060
I think I'd just, um, pick a pinch.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.780
I'm taking a quick rest after I kick him to bits.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:23.800
I can pinch him with my Bazooka.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:53.300
First stop.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:06:21.800
A chain!

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.680
We're supposed to be annoying you.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:27.730
I'm here!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.550
I guess you want it to be the hard way.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.830
You mean you want to battle your hardest?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:46.580
The notch is a little...

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:49.880
Failed.

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:00.940
Boing!

00:07:20.070 --> 00:08:49.000
I want a head while we're doing that.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:55.500
Attacking?

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.760
I'm not using any word attacks.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.880
Use the most powerful...

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.540
Use the most powerful attack!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.380
It's supposed to knock her out.

00:09:18.380 --> 00:10:02.750
It's failed.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:14.580
I'm learning to be the Beam Master of the Super Family.

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.260
Just like Agent Nine was.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.660
Uh, well he is, but I'm learning to be second in command.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:26.750
Oh, Beep-Beep!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:47.060
We're not those things that sprout up in your garden.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:48.960
Cut off!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:49.740
Join in there.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:11:02.400
Just you and me, Makuta and Colin, Destroyer.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:03.680
Hi-yah!

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:10.290
Rumpet Slam!

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:50.950
Hit me. Good thing I jumped in time.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:11.490
Makuta.

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:22.470
These guys are pathetic losers.

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:24.290
Who do you call pathetic?

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.370
It's Serena.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:13.630
Yup.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.470
Attack her!

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:23.500
How about your favorite color?

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.740
I don't have a favorite color.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:26.700
Ugh.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.000
Attack her with the hyper beam.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:31.560
Whaaaaat?

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:35.280
It's a hyper beam...

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:44.380
Oh.

00:14:48.850 --> 00:14:49.730
Wait a second.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:50.510
Tasty!

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:59.780
Oh, nobody makes fun of my dance!

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:28.100
Get in there.

